---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Home
description: Primary source genealogical research into the Woodruff, Chaney, Jackson, Davis, Bates, Helms, and allied families.
load_signature_font: true
---

{% set sidebar_items = [
  { label: "Ancestors", url: "/people/" },
  { label: "Families", url: "/families/" },
  { label: "Index", url: "/index/" },
  { label: "Writings", url: "/writings/" }
] %}

<div class="section-layout">
  {% include "partials/section-sidebar.njk" %}

  <div class="section-content">
    <div class="page-header">
      <h1>Name Index</h1>
      <p class="page-intro">
        Everyone connected to this family, alphabetically by first name: direct-line ancestors, collateral relatives, spouses, children, and named friends and associates, with links to wherever they can be read, whether a full profile, an entry on someone else's page, or a mention in a research note, journal entry, or family narrative. People who appear only incidentally within a source citation, such as officiants, witnesses, physicians, or record-keepers, are documented there rather than indexed here.
      </p>
    </div>

    {% set sortedEntries = collections.people | mergedPeopleIndex(peopleIndex) | sortedPeopleIndex %}

    <nav class="index-jumpnav" aria-label="Jump to letter">
      <ul>
        {% for letter in sortedEntries | peopleIndexLetters %}
        <li><a href="#letter-{{ letter }}">{{ letter }}</a></li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ul>
    </nav>

    {% for entry in sortedEntries %}
    {% if entry.isNewLetter %}
    <h2 class="index-letter-heading" id="letter-{{ entry.letter }}">{{ entry.letter }}</h2>
    {% endif %}
    <section class="index-entry" id="{{ entry.slug }}">
      <h3 class="index-entry__name">{{ entry.name }}</h3>
      {% if entry.tags %}
      <div class="index-entry__tags">
        {% for tag in entry.tags %}
        <span class="badge badge--{{ tag }}">{{ tag | replace("-", " ") }}</span>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
      {% endif %}
      <ul class="index-entry__appearances">
        {% for a in entry.appearances %}
        <li><a href="{{ a.url }}">{{ a.label }}</a></li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ul>
    </section>
    {% endfor %}

  </div>
</div>